["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Byrne Explains How Forgotten Ideas Come Back to Life Minsky moment Portland cement lime clasts\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-oddlots-古罗马混凝土两千年不裂-现代配方却只敢保50年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>古羅馬混凝土兩千年不裂，現代配方卻只敢保50年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅馬混凝土裡能自愈裂縫的石灰顆粒並非技術失傳，而是被工業偏見和商業利益一起擱置，直到MIT團隊十幾年前重新驗證了它的自愈能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">思想復興</span><span class=\"tag\">羅馬混凝土</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1366: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin PEPFAR PrEP Coxsackievirus lipid nanoparticle (LNP) microtesla magnetic therapy (MMT)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-twiv-美国切断艾滋病援助后-乌干达和津巴布韦治疗量骤降三成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>美國切斷艾滋病援助後，烏干達和津巴布韋治療量驟降三成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">來自烏干達和津巴布韋四家機構的真實數據：治療覆蓋率降31.5%，檢測降63.8%，暴露前預防用藥降71.6%——斷供意味著病毒繼續傳播、更多人死於本可預防的艾滋病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共衛生撥款</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CoreWeave Crash, AI Trade Cracks, Anthropic IPO Red Flags, Bill Gates Doomer CDS neocloud payback period net revenue retention distillation Jevons paradox\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-allin-anthropic该拿两千五百亿现金换低估值-而不是冲两万亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d03474c768c50875-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic該拿兩千五百億現金換低估值，而不是衝兩萬億</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chamath認為，比起把估值吹到兩萬億美元，Anthropic更該把IPO價格定得足夠低，一次性融到兩千到兩千五百億美元現金，因為未來幾年融資風險遠大於技術風險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力融資</span><span class=\"tag\">CoreWeave</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Financing In The AI Boom: Masters in Business with Bob Michele TIPS hyperscalers private credit dot plot muni bonds stable coin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-mastersinbiz-美元成唯一储备货币-日元欧元人民币黄金轮番冲击都败退/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>美元成唯一儲備貨幣：日元歐元人民幣黃金輪番衝擊都敗退</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">摩根資產管理固收負責人說，做了二十多年央行資產配置顧問，第一次想不出能替代美元的貨幣——日元、歐元、人民幣、黃金都被當作候選人，最後全部退場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">固定收益</span><span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"There&#x27;s never been a better time to go into math Erdős problems rising sea anything you can do I can do better future spiky frontier\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-karpathy-即使ai证明定理完全超过人类-数学的价值几乎不会改变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1eb151801bab97c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>即使AI證明定理完全超過人類，數學的價值幾乎不會改變</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">數學的錢主要來自教學，而非證明本身；AI把定理證明變成原始數據後，稀缺的是搭建理論、練口頭表達，以及誰該獲得學術功勞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數學</span><span class=\"tag\">學術體系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Release Me From This Demon swap prime brokerage intermediation mention markets\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-moneystuff-赌球换个说法叫-掉期合约-就绕开了各州博彩监管/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">37:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>賭球換個說法叫「掉期合約」，就繞開了各州博彩監管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kalshi 的體育投注賭的是同一場比賽、同樣的點數盤口，僅因掛在聯邦監管的掉期合約名下，就不受各州博彩法管轄，最高法院正要裁決這是否站得住腳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博彩監管</span><span class=\"tag\">預測市場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Can Write the Code. Can It Run the System? | Grepr CEO Jad Naous semantics vs syntax AI SRE auto-promotion / shredding chaos engineering WSL\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-a16z-ai能写出可投产的代码-但还没人敢让它独自运维一个分布式集群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>AI能寫出可投產的代碼，但還沒人敢讓它獨自運維一個分布式集群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">代碼的解空間和訓練數據同分布，AI才能一路狂飆；運維要應對訓練數據之外的真實世界，這道分野決定了AI接下來卡在哪一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI編程</span><span class=\"tag\">運維自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Vol.287｜且加餐：一日三餐，如何塑造人類社會的秩序？｜施展×李筠\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-cn27f438-维系民族两千年的不是军队-是一日三餐的饮食禁忌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">東腔西調</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>維繫民族兩千年的不是軍隊，是一日三餐的飲食禁忌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">吃飯是一種高頻到沒法偷懶的儀式：一天幾頓飯的重複比軍事、政治更能把身份焊進人的身體裡，猶太人靠飲食禁忌撐過亡國兩千年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">飲食人類學</span><span class=\"tag\">禮制與等級</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The French Political Crisis That&#x27;s Turning Into a Debt Crisis OMT TPI ESM doom loop debt-stabilizing deficit Zucman tax\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-oddlots-法国债务求救陷入死循环-开出的条件恰是政治上办不到的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">47:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>法國債務求救陷入死循環：開出的條件恰是政治上辦不到的事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歐洲央行願意兜底法國國債，前提是法國政府拿出可信的中期財政整頓承諾；但2027大選後勒龐和梅朗雄都可能拿不到國會多數，這個前提反而比今天更難兌現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法國財政</span><span class=\"tag\">歐債危機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Why &quot;How Was Your Day?&quot; Doesn&#x27;t Work, And What Actually Gets Kids Talking interviewing for pain Goldilocks\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-raisinggh-孩子不爱说话-不是因为父母不在场-而是不够-可接近/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0716da28e67c869b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">29:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>孩子不愛說話，不是因為父母不在場，而是不夠「可接近」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究顯示孩子是否袒露不取決於父母是否隨時在身邊，而取決於車上、散步這類低風險時刻父母會不會反應過度——越淡定越安全，追問越多孩子關得越緊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子溝通</span><span class=\"tag\">青春期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why a Chinese AI Lab’s Product Lead Thinks AGI is “Inevitable” | Richard Bian harness semantic routing MoE (Mixture of Experts) domain-enhanced model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-chinatalk-蚂蚁大模型产品负责人-agi已经没法叫停-也慢不下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f842f278f81ead1d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>螞蟻大模型產品負責人：AGI已經沒法叫停，也慢不下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的邏輯是：資本已經把這塊石頭推下坡，所有玩家都朝同一個方向加速衝；哪怕出現過幾次強力叫停的嘗試，答案依然是——不能停，也慢不下來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"IGBTs Took Silicon Power to the Next Level IGBT latch-up conductivity modulation Deep P+ parasitic NPN BJT\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-asianometry-让igbt真正好用的秘诀-是故意调低它的电流上限/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8d76566e7179c7c2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>讓IGBT真正好用的秘訣，是故意調低它的電流上限</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">東芝工程師中川昭夫發現，解決IGBT閂鎖燒燬問題的辦法不是把安全電流上限往上提，而是把器件飽和電流主動壓到閂鎖門檻之下，讓它先飽和而不是先燒穿。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">功率半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">IGBT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From Posting to Policy: Saif Khan on DUV and the AI Balance DUV immersion lithography EUV lithography RSI (recursive self-improvement) MATCH Act IFP (Institute for Progress)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-chinatalk-继续出口duv光刻机-恐让美国十亿芯片产能优势拱手让人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba99cbd30a45f8e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">59:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>繼續出口DUV光刻機，恐讓美國十億芯片產能優勢拱手讓人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國智庫測算：若放行次代DUV光刻機，中國2030年代芯片產能可能追平美國；現在收緊出口，差距會被鎖定在近百倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">DUV光刻機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to get into AI safety in 3 months (article reading by career advisor Matt Beard) BlueDot course EA Forum LessWrong deliberate practice fellowship\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-eightythousand-ai安全招聘效率低到离谱-先把活干出来比投简历更快被看见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08f7aec7acf61633-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">18:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全招聘效率低到離譜：先把活幹出來比投簡歷更快被看見</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為人才市場效率低到難以篩選，公開寫作、公開做項目、主動建立人脈，比海投簡歷更快能讓你被AI安全領域的招聘方看見。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">職業轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"When AI Agents Start Spending Your Money | Alex Rampell &amp; Terry Angelos VGS (Very Good Security) PAN network token PCI DSS agentic token chargeback\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-a16z-ai代理能替你刷卡的三个月-从零冲到每周几百万笔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>AI代理能替你刷卡的三個月：從零衝到每週幾百萬筆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">支付憑證讓agent從「推薦你買」變成「替你買」,VGS這類憑證金庫由此從單人用升級為多人共享，新的agentic token標準三個月內就從零衝到每週幾百萬筆。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang | Does AI Revenue Justify Capex, &#x27;27 AI Bottlenecks, Singularity, Open vs Closed &amp; more Physical AI Digital twin Zero trust Fungible compute RevShare Navier-Stokes\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-bg2-黄仁勋-算力泡沫的风险被算错了账-不该全押在两家ai实验室身上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fadb1586fa86c61b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">BG2</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：算力泡沫的風險被算錯了賬，不該全押在兩家AI實驗室身上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把NVIDIA的收入拆成三等份——經典計算、前沿實驗室、海量新創公司各佔三分之一，真正卡住明年43吉瓦新增算力的是土地電力和廠房，不是兩家實驗室的收入曲線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">資本開支</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Revolutionizing Cybersecurity and AI-Driven Science with OpenAI President Greg Brockman Dots Daybreak defender&#x27;s window debate / iterative amplification generative UI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-nopriors-openai总裁断言-网络安全支出该超过软件开发本身支出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/857d9061e21bb4fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">39:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI總裁斷言：網絡安全支出該超過軟件開發本身支出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">軟件因AI變得極度廉價，可靠與安全才是真正稀缺的東西——OpenAI內部曾讓四分之一工程師停工專職補漏洞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI數學突破</span><span class=\"tag\">藥物研發</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Madness of Markets (Alex Edmans) | #431 limits to arbitrage law of one price big market delusion illusory truth effect equity premium puzzle\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-rationalreminder-一个国家输掉世界杯-次日股市真的会跌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>一個國家輸掉世界盃，次日股市真的會跌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究追蹤一千多場世界盃淘汰賽發現，球迷情緒會讓次日本國股市下跌約0.5%,說明價格不僅由基本面決定，也會被情緒左右。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行為金融學</span><span class=\"tag\">過度反應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jeff Yan&#x27;s Plan to Bring the Entire Financial Industry Onto Hyperliquid Oracle Deployer Dutch auction Perpetual futures (perps) HIP3\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-oddlots-想装下全部金融的hyperliquid-靠27个验证节点运行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>想裝下全部金融的Hyperliquid，靠27個驗證節點運行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人說目標是用一條鏈裝下全部金融，但目前驗證節點總共只有30多個、排名前27的在實際運行網絡，跑一個節點只需128G內存的消費級機器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">永續合約</span><span class=\"tag\">Oracle機制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Is the death penalty cruel and unusual? blood atonement evolving standards of decency mitigating evidence majestic generalities\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-throughline-最高法院说死刑-像被闪电击中般随机-全国叫停-四年后又恢复/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/52f805d49b676f98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>最高法院說死刑「像被閃電擊中般隨機」，全國叫停，四年後又恢復</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「殘忍與非常」四個字從未被制憲者定義清楚，最高法院靠「社會成熟過程中不斷演進的道德標準」反覆重寫它的邊界，死刑因此被全國廢除，又在四年內捲土重來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">死刑</span><span class=\"tag\">第八修正案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Viking Origins: The Nordic Iron Age Pre-Roman Iron Age Migration Period Vendel Period bog bodies wandering settlements\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-ancients-维京时代只是尾声-北欧铁器时代的一千五百年被严重低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90576ce4c40955d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>維京時代只是尾聲：北歐鐵器時代的一千五百年被嚴重低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">維京時代常被當作北歐歷史的起點，但研究者認為它其實是一千五百年鐵器時代演化到壓力頂點的產物，而不是憑空出現的輝煌開端。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">維京時代</span><span class=\"tag\">鐵器時代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The History of the Illuminati Streisand effect Protocols of the Elders of Zion Jacobins Federalists\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-historyhit-光明会真实存在但一事无成-查禁它的政府成就了阴谋论神话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/604115789971ea93-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">45:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>光明會真實存在但一事無成：查禁它的政府成就了陰謀論神話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴伐利亞政府查禁光明會並公開全部繳獲文件後，這個內訌不斷、一事無成的讀書會反而成了兩百年來陰謀論的萬能模板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">陰謀論</span><span class=\"tag\">啟蒙運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Elizabeth Holmes&#x27; Husband Billy Evans: The Trial, Prison &amp; Nathan Fielder&#x27;s Documentary First Step Act Raman spectroscopy BOP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-allin-霍姆斯丈夫-她最大的错不是欺诈-是守口如瓶三年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c91d628233831dd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">41:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>霍姆斯丈夫：她最大的錯不是欺詐，是守口如瓶三年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">比利·埃文斯說，法官只要求「在法庭上打這場官司，不在媒體上打」,霍姆斯就守規矩守到全程對媒體一字不提；他認為這才是她犯下的最大錯誤，因為她的力量本來就在於講述自己的故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Theranos</span><span class=\"tag\">聯邦訴訟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"184: 與陳哲的「具身季報26Q3」：Astra衝擊後，通用模型會吃掉Robotics嗎？ In-Context Learning (ICL) Physical RSI VLA World Action Model (WAM) Robot Dojo FCC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-latetalk-gpt-6-astra能自己设计机器人实验-让ai训练ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cca2d003691224c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>GPT-6 Astra能自己設計機器人實驗，讓AI訓練AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當通用語言模型可以直接在仿真環境裡調試、訓練自己的機器人策略時，獨立具身模型公司「物理AI大於數字AI」的估值敘事就開始鬆動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">通用大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>"]